# THE PUBLISHER FIGURES, WHICH THIS REPOSITORY MUST NEVER TRACK AGAIN.
# `raster_root.roots()` searches the package directory on purpose - a developer
# who has the originals should be able to drop them beside the code and work -
# and that is also the path by which ten of them came to be tracked in a public
# repository. Every name below is a key of `raster_root.RASTERS` or an input to
# `propose.py`; `test_reproducibility` asserts that none of them is in
# `git ls-files`, because a .gitignore can be overridden with `git add -f`.
323_p5_fig2.jpeg
397_fig1.jpeg
397_fig2.jpeg
397_fig3.jpeg
397_fig4.jpeg
397_fig5.jpeg
ID386_Fig2_publisher_898x1662.png
fixtures/id323_fig1.jpeg
id323_fig1.tar
id323_fig2.tar
