# THE GALLERY'S OWN OUTPUT. `png/verify.py` writes these on every run and most
# of them are crops of publisher figures. A GLOB, because the gallery grows: the
# four were named by hand in v9.16 and the fifth and sixth would have been
# tracked the moment they were drawn - and worse, this block was dropped
# entirely when the publisher-path block above was shipped over it, which is why
# `test_reproducibility` checks the INDEX and not this file.
# `png/E1_provenance_matrix.png` is a table with no figure in it and stays.
png/G*.png
